{"id":10,"date":"2024-07-29T08:24:52","date_gmt":"2024-07-29T08:24:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?page_id=10"},"modified":"2026-01-23T12:51:38","modified_gmt":"2026-01-23T12:51:38","slug":"refund_returns","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/refund_returns\/","title":{"rendered":"Refund and Returns Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"10\" class=\"elementor elementor-10\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7713bab e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7713bab\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-234689a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"234689a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Return and Refund Policy<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fdceed1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fdceed1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"384\">Thank you for shopping with Shop Cardboard Boxes. We aim to provide quality packaging solutions, but if you\u2019re not completely satisfied with your purchase, please review the policy below.<\/p><hr data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"389\" \/><h3 data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"402\">Returns<\/h3><p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"503\">We accept returns for both <strong data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"471\">defective and non-defective products<\/strong> under the following conditions:<\/p><ul data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"852\"><li data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"587\"><p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"587\">Items must be <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"531\">unused<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"540\">new<\/strong>, and returned in their <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"586\">original packaging<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"666\"><p data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"666\">You must submit a return request within <strong data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"641\">10 days<\/strong> of receiving your order.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"756\"><p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"756\">Returns are accepted <strong data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"706\">by mail only<\/strong>. In-person or drop-off returns are not supported.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"811\"><p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"811\">A <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"810\">return label will be included in your package<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"852\"><p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"852\">We do <strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"851\">not charge a restocking fee<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1018\">To start a return, email <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"910\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"908\">info@shopcardboardboxes.com<\/a><\/strong> with your order number and reason for return. If there\u2019s visible damage or a defect, please include photos.<\/p><hr data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1023\" \/><h3 data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1038\">Exchanges<\/h3><p data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1219\">Exchanges are accepted within the same <strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1096\">10-day window<\/strong>, provided the item is in new condition. A replacement will be shipped once the original product is returned and inspected.<\/p><hr data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1224\" \/><h3 data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1237\">Refunds<\/h3><p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1281\">Once your return is approved and received:<\/p><ul data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1456\"><li data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1339\"><p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1339\">Refunds will be processed within <strong data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1338\">10 business days<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1401\"><p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1401\">Funds will be returned to your <strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1400\">original payment method<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1456\"><p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1456\">All refunds are processed in <strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1440\">USD<\/strong> (U.S. Dollars).<\/p><\/li><\/ul><hr data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1461\" \/><h3 data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1487\">Non-Returnable Items<\/h3><p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1518\">We do not accept returns for:<\/p><ul data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1651\"><li data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1547\"><p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1547\">Used or opened products<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1610\"><p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1610\">Custom-printed or made-to-order packaging unless defective<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1651\"><p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1651\">Items returned after the 10-day period<\/p><\/li><\/ul><hr data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1656\" \/><h3 data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1672\">Need Help?<\/h3><p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1829\">\ud83d\udce7 <strong data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1687\">Email:<\/strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"mailto:info@shopcardboardboxes.com\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1715\">info@shopcardboardboxes.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1718\" \/>\ud83d\udcde <strong data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1731\">Phone:<\/strong> <a href=\"tel:+15033580443\"><span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\"><b>+1 (503) 358-0443<\/b><\/span><\/a><br data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1750\" \/>\ud83d\udccd <strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1765\">Address:<\/strong> 1639 70th St,Brooklyn, New York, 11204 USA<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1206399 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1206399\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd068fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"cd068fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\">\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"container\" data-elementor-id=\"2174\" class=\"elementor elementor-2174\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-652454b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"652454b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d7b314f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d7b314f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc4a86f elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cc4a86f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Let\u2019s work together<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ebe5b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8ebe5b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading